<div>
    <h3>关于对2024级本科生进行基础层（C2级）实验实践能力达标测试的通知</h3>
   <div class="time"><span>发布时间：</span>2026-09-20 10:35:43<span>来源：</span>
    <span> 点击：</span><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1482657449, 35782)</script></div>

    
    <div id="vsb_content_6"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Calibri Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #5B9BD5;  --docx-accent2-color: #ED7D31;  --docx-accent3-color: #A5A5A5;  --docx-accent4-color: #FFC000;  --docx-accent5-color: #4472C4;  --docx-accent6-color: #70AD47;  --docx-hlink-color: #0563C1;  --docx-folhlink-color: #954F72;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx table, table.docx_5 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}p.docx_2 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}p.docx_2 {  text-align: justify;}p.docx_2 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}p.docx_3 {  text-align: left;}p.docx_3 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}p.docx_3 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}p.docx_4 {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}p.docx_4 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}p.docx_4 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}table.docx_6 td {  border-top: 0.50pt solid black;  border-left: 0.50pt solid black;  border-bottom: 0.50pt solid black;  border-right: 0.50pt solid black;  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}span.docx_8 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_8 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}span.docx_8 p {  text-align: justify;}span.docx_9 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_9 p {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}span.docx_9 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}span.docx_10 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_10 p {  text-align: left;}span.docx_10 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各学院：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">根据《关于规范本科生实验实践能力达标测试工作的通知（本字〔2023〕161号）文件相关规定，按照教学计划安排，电工电子国家级实验教学示范中心将于10月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日-11月20日进行基础层（C2级）实验实践能力达标测试，测试对象为202</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">级全体本科生及202</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">级等C2未通过的本科生。具体安排如下：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">一、选题及预约时间</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选题时间：10月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日～10月1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">预约时间：选题后根据已安排的测试时间预约，测试开始前</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">12</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">小时系统自动关闭预约及撤销功能。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">注：未预约或预约后未测试的学生，特殊原因标注“缺考”，成绩记载为“不通过”。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">二、选题及预约方法</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">符合大学生实验实践能力达标测试C2级别的各专业学生，登陆网站https://c2.xidian.edu.cn/,进入“实验能力达标测试系统”进行选题并预约，选题后才能预约测试。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">三、测试时间</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">10月1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日～11月20日</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">四、测试方式</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1.C2级电一类和电二类测试的方法如下：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 40pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（1）登陆网站https://c2.xidian.edu.cn/,进入“实验能力达标测试系统”进行选题并预约测试时间，根据预约时间和指定实验室（E楼II区2-5层），提前10分钟到场。测试老师根据所选题目评分标准及评分表，采取“单人单组”的方式，逐项进行测试与记录。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 40pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（2）参加测试的学生须携带本人身份证、一卡通，并自觉放在所测作品左侧。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">无身份证、一卡通者不允许参加测试。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 40pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（3）测试允许携带自己的测试仪器设备。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">注：所选题目材料自备，实验中心只测试作品并评分。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2.参加数学、经管类、人文艺术及外语类测试学生，请与各类别的负责教师联系测试的具体事宜，具体联系方式如下：</span></p><table class="docx_6" style="width: 417.5pt; table-layout: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><colgroup><col style="width: 63.55pt;"><col style="width: 155.95pt;"><col style="width: 70.85pt;"><col style="width: 56.7pt;"><col style="width: 70.45pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="height: 24.75pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold;">测试</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold;">类别</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold;">专业</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold;">测试地点</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold;">联系</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold;">教师</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold;">联系</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold;">电话</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 46.9pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">电一</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">通信工程学院各专业、电子工程学院各专业、计算机科学与技术学院各专业、机电工程学院（自动化、机器人工程、电气工程及其自动化、测控技术与仪器专业）、光电工程学院（电子科学与技术、光电信息科学与工程专业）、物理学院（电子信息科学与技术、电波传播与天线专业）、微电子学院各专业、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">集成电路</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">学部各专业</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">生命科学技术学院（生物医学工程、智能医学工程专业）、空间科学与技术学院各专业、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">信息力学与感知工程学院各</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">专业</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">/</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">/</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">/</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 46.9pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">电二</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">机电工程学院（机械制造及其自动化、工业设计、电子封装技术专业）、物理学院（应用物理学专业）、先进材料与纳米科技学院</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">各专业</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">、网络与信息安全学院各专业、人工智能学院各专业</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">/</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">/</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">/</span></p></td></tr><tr style="text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">数学</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">数学与统计学院各专业</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">F楼4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">21</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">室</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">唐老师</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">13087592595</span></p></td></tr><tr style="text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">经管</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">经济与管理学院各专业</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">F楼11</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">室</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">姜老师</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">18009227396</span></p></td></tr><tr style="text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">人文艺术类</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">人文学院各专业</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">信远</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">II</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">-117</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">张老师</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">13227066518</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 16.55pt; text-align: center;"><td rowspan="3" style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">外语</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">英语</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">信远II-424室</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">李老师</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">18049661507</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 16.95pt; text-align: center;"><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">日语</span></p></td><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">王老师</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">18789405850</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 13.6pt; text-align: center;"><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">翻译</span></p></td><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">仝老师</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">15191908448</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3.各专业类别学生测试完成后，由相应负责教师提交成绩至C2达标测试系统，由电工电子国家级实验教学示范中心汇总后上传至教务处系统，测试成绩请在学校教务管理系统https://ehall.xidian.edu.cn查询。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">五、联系方式</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">电 &nbsp;话：029-81891084</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">地 &nbsp;址：南校区E楼II区-420 </span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">联系人：吕老师、李老师</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">如有问题，可在测试系统的留言簿上留言</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-align: right; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">电工电子国家级实验教学示范中心</span></p><p style="text-align: right; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">202</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年9月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">20</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p></article></section>
